1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Marlow says I owe him forty-seven cranks.
I counted the lift chains myself. There are only twelve.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:11,000
I woke up underground with a headache
and a rat going through my pockets.

3
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The kid's name is Nib. He failed to rob me,
so now he's my problem. His words.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Then the possum showed me the lift.
One crank per paid debt. Forty-seven debts.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,500
Twelve chains. I counted.
So either the possum can't do math —
